BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All I Want For Christmas Is A U-Haul Drag Bingo Brunch @ Granite B
 rewery
DTSTART:20261206T120500
DTEND:20261206T120500
UID:e486107f4b8255d493ddcd5e0d0c6f54@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Scissor Sisters celebrate the holidays together\, butch! 🎄
 🏳️‍🌈 ALL I WANT FOR CHRISTMAS IS A U-HAUL: DRAG BRUNCH 🏳️
 ‍🌈🎄 🎶 I don’t want a lot for Christmas… just a girlfriend\,
  matching flannel\, and someone to move in with after three dates. 🛻
 💋 Toronto\, it’s time to deck the halls\, pack the Subaru\, and turn 
 that situationship into a shared lease because All I Want for Christmas Is
  a U-Haul is coming to Granite Brewery on December 6th! 🎁✨ Whether yo
 u’re a gold-star lesbian\, a bisexual disaster\, a cottage-core girlfrie
 nd\, or just here for the emotional support flannel\, this is YOUR holiday
  event. 💌 THE SAPPHIC HOLIDAY SURVIVAL GUIDE: • Bring your situations
 hip. Leave with a U-Haul quote. • If she says she’s “not ready for a
  relationship\,” she’s probably already made you a Christmas playlist.
  • Matching Christmas pyjamas are basically a marriage proposal. • And
  remember\, lesbians don’t date. They meet once\, exchange playlists\, a
 nd start browsing two-bedroom apartments. Whether you’re coupled up\, si
 ngle and yearning\, or actively trying to figure out if your best friend i
 s flirting with you\, come celebrate the most wonderful time of the queer 
 year. Because baby\, all you want for Christmas is a U-Haul… and maybe a
  girl who can hang a shelf. 🎄🛠️💋 Date &amp\; Time: Sunday\, Dec
 ember 6th | 12:00 PM Location: Granite Brewery (245 Eglinton Ave E\, Toron
 to) Tickets: $15 Early Bird\, $20 GA Menu: A curated brunch buffet featuri
 ng all your favourite items! The buffet includes coffee/tea\, salads and d
 essert! NOTE: Brunch is not included in your ticket price. A $25 minimum s
 pend is required\, and a 18% gratuity will be applied to all bills Age Req
 uirement: This show is all ages! Cast: Sucka Queen &amp\; Guests! Get read
 y for a one-of-a-kind Drag Brunch Bingo experience at Granite Brewery! Exp
 ect high-energy drag performances\, hilarious bingo rounds\, and fabulous 
 prizes! Doors open at 11:30am! 🌟 What to Expect: ✨ Show-stopping drag
  performances from Sucka and others! 🎱 Bingo games with exciting prizes
  💸 Please remember to bring cash to tip the queens! 🪑 Communal seati
 ng – purchase tickets in groups to be seated together 🚗 Free parking 
 on-site Gather your friends\, showcase your pride\, and come ready to slay
 ! ⚡️🎤🥂 Get your tickets now – seats fill up fast! ‍
LOCATION:Granite Brewery\, 245 Eglinton Avenue East
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/all-i-want-for-christmas-is-a-u-haul-drag-
 bingo-brunch-granite-brewery
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
