DTSTART:20261206T220000
DTEND:20261206T220000
UID:767a4db345685f211b975b69087653b4@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Bust out your PJs and dance with the DJs!! We are ecstatic to 
 host our 3rd annual SUPERSEXE Slumber Party Dec. 6 Come indulge in the one
 -of-a-kind silliness\, and deliciously Pure Campy fashion at the 33rd inst
 allment of Stella Maise&#x27\;s solo collective show\; SUPERSEXE. Doors op
 en at 10:00pm \; doors close at 1:30am $20 at the door 10pm-1am\, $5 after
  1am! Events ends at 2:30am. SUPERSEXE LINEUP Stella Maise (@stellamaisemu
 sic / @estellamaise on IG) WITH SPECIAL GUEST DJs TBA Location: SeeScape\,
  347 Keele St. T.O (This venue is unfortunately inaccessible\, no entry ra
 mp available\, and this show will be taking place in the upstairs area whi
 ch is only accessible by stairs. Apologies for any limitations caused\; we
  look forward to our future events that are within fully accessible venues
 !) Theme: SLUMBER PARTY (There will be a pillow fight at 12am! BYOP aka Br
 ing your own pillow/plushy) Music Vibe: Music vibes will be wholesome GIRL
 YPOP. Pop\, Happy Hardcore\, Bass\, Electrohouse\, Jungle and beyond. An e
 clectic compilation of delicious cult hits and deep cuts. Important: This 
 is not an adult play/kink/s3x party. Supersexe is an event for queer/trans
 /femme presenting people. If you do not fall under this bracket\, you must
  be accompanied by someone who does. NO REFUNDS Behind SUPERSEXE: A queer-
 led event\, spotlighting alternative artists and performers. SUPERSEXE is 
 named after the now-closed Montreal-based strip club\, Super Sexe\, that u
 nfortunately burnt down in 2021. I (Stella) had always wanted to go since 
 I was a kid. The glitzy exterior\, the beautiful femme style\, the extrava
 gance. I wanted to encapsulate the image in my head of what could&#x27\;ve
  been through this series (yes\, series!) of SUPERSEXE. ‍
LOCATION:See-Scape\, 347 Keele St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/supersexe---slumber-party
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
