 e year - Our unofficial official holiday kink extravaganza! Our final Play
 ground Kink party of 2026 is coming—and as is our custom\, we’re going
  out with a filthy little festive bang. December 12th. Mark your calendars
  for our fourth and final party of the year: our unofficially official Hol
 iday Kink Extravaganza! This year\, we’re turning the holiday spirit int
 o something a little more Playground—and putting that spirit toward a gr
 eat cause. 2026’s fundraising cause: INDIGENOUS HARM REDUCTION TORONTO F
 rontline heroes doing essential work in our community. And who better to h
 ost the festivities than our outrageously hot and questionably behaved DIR
 TY SANTAS? Here’s your chance to indulge in that weird fantasy of sittin
 g on Santa’s lap and…. Plus of course we have THE MUSIC! Our guests an
 d residents for this event will be: Mewsi Stacxion Resident DJ Acid Burn R
 esident VJ DusX Expect dungeons\, dance floors\, slutty go-gos\, sexy elve
 s\, naughty (adult) children\, filthy Santas\, festive debauchery\, and a 
 whole lot of chosen-family chaos—all in support of a great cause. Come c
 elebrate the end of another wild year with your\, get gloriously inappropr
 iate\, and help us give something back to the people doing the hard work i
 n our community. EARLY BIRD BLOCK 1 IS ONLY $20! Limited quantity—once t
 hey&#x27\;re gone\, they&#x27\;re gone. Discount codes are available for B
 IPOC folks\, frontline outreach workers\, sex workers\, hospitality and ni
 ghtlife workers\, and anyone who could use a little extra support. If cost
