 orded…which really isn’t saying much! What better way to spend a Tuesd
 ay evening than singing along to seminal classics like “Sleigh Ride”\,
  “Christmas (Baby Please Come Home)”\, and in some cultures\, “Oh Sa
 nta!” Come on out to Three Dollar Bill in Parkdale on December 15th at 7
 :30pm to join in the festivities and see how many versions of “All I Wan
 t For Christmas Is You” Mimi can perform in one show! It may be over the
