 FREE Entry before 10pm) The Wiggler: $23 BRING A TOY\, SPREAD SOME JOY\, A
 ND GET WIGGLY! It’s that magical time of year again when the Wiggly fami
 ly comes together to celebrate the holidays\, give back to our community\,
  and dance the night away! Every year\, our amazing community collects mor
 e toys than the year before\, and this year we’re determined to SMASH LA
 ST YEAR’S RECORD! We suggest an unwrapped toy. This year we partnered up
  with our friends at the Red Door Family Shelter. All toys collected will 
 be donated to Red Door Family Shelter\, helping organize birthday parties 
 for children living in local shelters. Let’s make sure every child gets 
 to feel special on their birthday! 6 PM – 10 PM | FAMILY HOLIDAY FUN! Br
 ing the little Wigglers! Kids are welcome with a parent or guardian. Enjoy
  special holiday mocktails\, festive cheer\, and rumour has it… SANTA mi
 ght even make an appearance! 10 PM – EARLY MONDAY MORNING | LET’S GET 
 WIGGLY! Once the little ones head home\, the party kicks into high gear wi
 th BOUNCY BEATS\, holiday mischief\, and a dance floor full of Wiggly love
 ! BOUNCY BEATS TILL EARLY MONDAY MORNING! Put on your Sunday best\, sip yo
 ur tips\, or ride that bender. Join us for a late check-out and reset your
  week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social. Every funky Sunday fun
 day\, at your service! with Toronto’s finest: MANZONE &amp\; STRONG and 
 the Wiggly family. COMPLIMENTARY Entry before 10pm with RSVP Open at 6 pm 
 ~ $6 Vodka &amp\; Beer specials before 11pm + Wellness Cabin by Sacred Han
 ds it’s a Sunday thang… Sun Dec 20: Manzone &amp\; Strong | TAKiN | Ty
 ler Hill | Barroness | Nikki Atana | Paolo | ﻿Dick Diamonds &amp\; Wiley
